{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YWbGYcWxXkA21jPD6WdtUz","type":"tool_result","content":"# Nimbus University Hostel Rules (mock document)\n\n_Mock content written for Assignment 8. It is not a real university's policy._\n\n1. **In-time:** Residents must be inside the hostel by 22:00 on weekdays and 23:00 on Saturdays.\n   Late entry needs a gate pass approved by the warden.\n2. **Visitors:** Visitors are allowed in the ground-floor lounge from 10:00 to 19:00 only, and must sign the register.\n3. **Quiet hours:** 23:00 to 06:00. No music without headphones.\n4. **Appliances:** Electric kettles and irons only. Heaters, induction cooktops and extension boards above 6 A are not allowed.\n5. **Mess:** Breakfast 07:30–09:00, lunch 12:30–14:00, dinner 19:30–21:30. Mess leave needs 24 hours' notice.\n6. **Room changes:** Apply to the warden's office in the first two weeks of a semester.\n7. **Ragging:** Zero tolerance. Report incidents to the anti-ragging helpline or the warden immediately.\n8. **Damage:** Residents pay for damage to hostel property in their room.\n4:Resource:  campus://hostel/rules  (the hostel rules document)\n26:HOSTEL_RULES = HERE / \"data\" / \"hostel_rules.md\"\n106:    \"campus://hostel/rules\",\n107:    name=\"hostel-rules\",\n108:    title=\"Hostel rules\",\n109:    description=\"The current hostel rules document (in-time, visitors, appliances, mess timings).\",\n112:def hostel_rules() -> str:\n113:    return HOSTEL_RULES.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"04268dfe-5f88-49e2-b790-25cf8cbe9730","uuid":"f74db2b9-6526-4444-aa89-f072daff587c","timestamp":"2026-11-18T08:44:17.168Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# Nimbus University Hostel Rules (mock document)\n\n_Mock content written for Assignment 8. It is not a real university's policy._\n\n1. **In-time:** Residents must be inside the hostel by 22:00 on weekdays and 23:00 on Saturdays.\n   Late entry needs a gate pass approved by the warden.\n2. **Visitors:** Visitors are allowed in the ground-floor lounge from 10:00 to 19:00 only, and must sign the register.\n3. **Quiet hours:** 23:00 to 06:00. No music without headphones.\n4. **Appliances:** Electric kettles and irons only. Heaters, induction cooktops and extension boards above 6 A are not allowed.\n5. **Mess:** Breakfast 07:30–09:00, lunch 12:30–14:00, dinner 19:30–21:30. Mess leave needs 24 hours' notice.\n6. **Room changes:** Apply to the warden's office in the first two weeks of a semester.\n7. **Ragging:** Zero tolerance. Report incidents to the anti-ragging helpline or the warden immediately.\n8. **Damage:** Residents pay for damage to hostel property in their room.\n4:Resource:  campus://hostel/rules  (the hostel rules document)\n26:HOSTEL_RULES = HERE / \"data\" / \"hostel_rules.md\"\n106:    \"campus://hostel/rules\",\n107:    name=\"hostel-rules\",\n108:    title=\"Hostel rules\",\n109:    description=\"The current hostel rules document (in-time, visitors, appliances, mess timings).\",\n112:def hostel_rules() -> str:\n113:    return HOSTEL_RULES.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01YWbGYcWxXkA21jPD6WdtUz","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"subcommandResults"}}]}
